For this page, I'd use a dark aerial Nairobi/city image with subtle election-operation imagery, rather than a picture of a politician. That keeps the platform focused on the operational system.

The important part is that there is no administrator registration button. Administrator accounts will be created/managed separately, so the public cannot create an admin account.

Next page should be "admin-dashboard.html" — the actual command centre, where the administrator can see Pending Agent Requests → Approve/Reject → Generate Agent Invitation → Assign Polling Station.
